Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0869/3799] soh: rename func_808B4978 -> BgSpot15Saku_Open

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: slides the drawbridge 2 units per frame on Z while playing the metal-gate loop, stopping at z < 2660 with the bridge-open sfx and a 30-frame settle.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Saku/z_bg_spot15_saku.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Saku/z_bg_spot15_saku.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Saku/z_bg_spot15_saku.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Saku/z_bg_spot15_saku.c
index dcd45cbc2..7c44de9b4 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Saku/z_bg_spot15_saku.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Saku/z_bg_spot15_saku.c
@@ -16,7 +16,8 @@ void BgSpot15Saku_Draw(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B4930: the initial action: waits for the trigger flag while INFTABLE_71 is unset, then arms a 2-frame delay and hands off to the opening action.
 void BgSpot15Saku_WaitToOpen(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B4930 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_808B4978(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B4978: slides the drawbridge 2 units per frame on Z while playing the metal-gate loop, stopping at z < 2660 with the bridge-open sfx and a 30-frame settle.
+void BgSpot15Saku_Open(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B4978 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_808B4A04(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play);
 
 const ActorInit Bg_Spot15_Saku_InitVars = {
@@ -62,11 +63,11 @@ void BgSpot15Saku_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
 void BgSpot15Saku_WaitToOpen(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->unk_168 && !Flags_GetInfTable(INFTABLE_71)) {
         this->timer = 2;
-        this->actionFunc = func_808B4978;
+        this->actionFunc = BgSpot15Saku_Open;  // was func_808B4978 [LLM:HIGH]
     }
 }
 
-void func_808B4978(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play) {
+void BgSpot15Saku_Open(BgSpot15Saku* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->timer == 0) {
         Audio_PlayActorSound2(&this->dyna.actor, NA_SE_EV_METALGATE_OPEN - SFX_FLAG);
         this->dyna.actor.world.pos.z -= 2.0f;
